<title>MEXICO: ICA gives officials 393,911 shares.</title>
<headline>ICA gives officials 393,911 shares.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican building firm Empresas ICA Sociedad Controladora SA de CV (ICA) said today it subscribed 393,911 shares from its treasury position for company officials.</p>
<p>ICA said in a report to the Mexican Stock Exchange that its outstanding nominal shares now totalled 105,618,504.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9562))</p>
</text>
